{"id":174811107218091,"type":"album","name":"One of These Nights","artist":"Eagles","year":1975,"weight":23,"info":{"cover":"https://dn710709.ca.archive.org/0/items/mbid-c122c4f1-1b23-4f28-a667-dc7908d60a1e/mbid-c122c4f1-1b23-4f28-a667-dc7908d60a1e-8690357981.jpg","yt":"UlyYGQwhB_8","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/eagles/one-of-these-nights"},"desc":"One of These Nights is the fourth studio album by the Eagles, released in 1975. The record's title song became the group's second #1 single on the Billboard Hot 100, in July of that year. The album released three Top 10 singles, \"One of These Nights\", \"Lyin' Eyes\", and \"Take It To The Limit\". Those singles reached #1, #2, and #4 respectively. The album became the band's first album to top the charts. The album sold 4 million copies and won the band its first Grammy for \"Lyin' Eyes\". \"Take It To The Limit\" became the band's first gold single ."},"artist_ref":{"id":106115726467187,"name":"The Eagles","info":{"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/178be204025c8d38a72113564b647baf/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":18872195504512,"type":"genre","name":"Pop Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":740,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":90510611927654,"type":"genre","name":"Country Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":425,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":251671925246370,"type":"genre","name":"Soft Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":418,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":133646791193319,"type":"genre","name":"Laurel Canyon Scene","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":200,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":82958032046503,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Soft Rock","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":92,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":177455037556203,"name":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Laurel Canyon Scene","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":115,"year":null,"